  fairlady). FEATURES-V2 LANE GOVERNED MANIFEST.

  Drop into .repo/local_manifests/ as 1vivy-features-v2.xml after:

      repo init -u https://github.com/crdroidandroid/android.git -b 16.0
      # base manifest pinned at a311bc97e4784ee24e8f97e377d06bdbff85b4bb

  then `repo sync`.

  USE THIS FILE INSTEAD OF 1vivy-rom.xml - NEVER ALONGSIDE IT.

  This is a STANDALONE composition. It declares the same paths as 1vivy-rom.xml,
  so placing both in local_manifests/ at once is a configuration error.

  THIS MANIFEST IS PUBLISHED-HEAD. Every revision below is at or past the head
  the published patch profile would produce. DO NOT run
  patches/patch/apply-patches.py against a tree synced from this file: the
  profile is already contained in these heads by construction, and replaying it
  would DOUBLE-APPLY. 1vivy-rom.xml is the opposite lane - it pins the profile's
  BASE commits and the replay there is mandatory. The two must not be mixed.

  Composed 2026-08-05.

  Seven topic-bearing repos ride the 1vivy topic branch staging/features-v2/all-v2:

      hardware/oplus                       1vivy/android_hardware_oplus
      frameworks/base                      1vivy/android_frameworks_base
      device/oneplus/infiniti              1vivy/android_device_oneplus_infiniti
      device/oneplus/sm8850-common         1vivy/android_device_oneplus_sm8850-common
      vendor/oneplus/camera-sm8850-common  1vivy/vendor_oneplus_camera-sm8850-common
      vendor/oneplus/infiniti              1vivy/proprietary_vendor_oneplus_infiniti
      vendor/oneplus/sm8850-common         1vivy/proprietary_vendor_oneplus_sm8850-common

  Four non-topic camera-port source targets are pinned at their PROMOTED 16.0
  head as full 40-char SHAs, so this lane is offline-immune and cannot drift:

      frameworks/native                 7e6caf56f2a6550e89e03286cbc9f3401629b2c3
      frameworks/av                     bade1ca9f81d7b819e27d39497349531359c3b9f
